        <Description>Consumer-facing benchmark report models and builders: a polymorphic, versioned schema (BenchmarkReport base with MicroBenchmarkReport/LoadTestReport subtypes) shared by the Lyo benchmark exporter, the dashboard, and external viewers (portfolio/test gateway).</Description>
